      "content": "it feels like i literally don't even exist anymore. like i woke up today and everyone i actually knew just... stopped. no one is texting, no one is posting, it's like they all just collectively decided i wasn't real. i'm just staring at my phone and it’s just a void. i feel like a ghost walking around.",
