    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"disconnected\" though. when i go to the places i used to go, it's like i'm invisible. people look right through me. i feel like i've already been erased from the world, like the person i used to be is just... gone. there's nothing left of me in anyone else's life. it's just quiet. so quiet.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
